WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Triply is an AI-assisted travel-planning concept, designed to make every step feel effortless.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Start with the traveler's context: destination, dates, and the kind of trip.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Review ideas, itinerary details, and a map together in one planning workspace.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Review the plan and share the adventure. This is a concept, without live booking.
